{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36586","headline":"春晚寄锺尚书 · 罗隐","name":"春晚寄锺尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宰府初开忝末尘，四年谈笑隔通津。\n官资肯便矜中路，酒醆还应忆故人。\n江畔旧游秦望月，槛前公事镜湖春。\n如今莫问西禅坞，一炷寒香老病身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}